  "text_21": "Ticket Pricing Details",
  "text_22": "1. Residents of Taichung, spouses of newly arrived residents, and students from other counties and cities who attend schools in Taichung can enjoy a special discount of ‘10 kilometers free + a maximum fare of 10 yuan for distances over 10 kilometers’ by using electronic tickets linked to the city’s resident-only transportation discount program.",
  "text_23": "2. For non-residents, fares are calculated based on the distance traveled. When paying in cash, the full fare is 20 yuan and the half fare is 11 yuan. Any distance beyond the basic fare is charged according to the actual distance traveled. When using electronic tickets, the full fare is reduced by 5 yuan, resulting in a fare of 15 yuan (5 yuan discount), and the half fare remains 11 yuan. The excess distance is still calculated and charged accordingly.",
  "text_24": "3. The Taichung City Government has issued senior citizen cards that offer special benefits for transportation. Specifically, there’s no charge for distances up to 10 kilometers. For distances over 10 kilometers, a maximum of 10 points will be deducted from the fare.",
